# Q Light Controller Plus - tileable pleated stage curtain
# One repeating section: 1.0 m wide, 4.0 m tall, centred on the origin.
# Sections abut seamlessly along X: the fold profile is a sum of cosines whose
# periods all divide the section width, so profile and slope match on both edges.
# Generated procedurally - folds of uneven width and depth from five neighbouring
# harmonics, 60% of the hem fullness still carried at the head, and the folds
# drifting slightly down the drop. Fabric thickness 0.022 m.
mtllib curtain_tile_1m.mtl
o Curtain
